{"version":1,"content":"<p>由古天樂出品的首個大型綜藝舞台劇《人夫集團》頭場，前天（10日）假西九文化區戲曲中心公演。</p><p>古天樂、黃子華、劉德華、張學友、陳潔靈、林峯、張敬軒、Twins、容祖兒、方力申、林盛斌、連詩雅及老公陳家樂、衛詩雅等送花籃祝賀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:56.099756+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:51:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T02:58:07.295121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:42.170992+00:00","content_hash":"3622345773dc3fb13528b68b681244c01f5955e8bcdd87e7fc3476907fe33e3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}